      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83e\udde9 Content Pack V3 Minimal Typed Demo\n\nThis workflow demonstrates how to add and retrieve exactly four typed values from a JSON content pack:\n\n| Field | Alias | Comfy Type | Expected Value |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| `content.message` | `message` | `STRING` | Hello from Content Pack V3 |\n| `numeric.seed` | `seed` | `INT` | 424242 |\n| `numeric.guidance_scale` | `guidance_scale` | `FLOAT` | 7.5 |\n| `media.hero_image` | `hero_image` | `IMAGE` | Tiny inline PNG |\n\n## \ud83d\udd01 Flow\n\n```text\nSource JSON \u2192 Build V3 \u2192 Alias/Labels \u2192 Save V3 \u2192 Load V3 \u2192 Typed Get Nodes\n```\n\n## \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Image behavior\n\nThe image is stored in the source JSON as a `data:image/png;base64,...` URI.  \n`Get Image V3` rehydrates it into a real Comfy `IMAGE` output.\n"
      ],
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd8 README: Add Image + String + Int + Float",
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
