      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83d\ude80 Run Steps\n\n1. Run the workflow once.\n2. Check **Build Report**, **Alias Preview**, **Save JSON**, and **Load Summary**.\n3. Confirm the four typed extractor nodes produce:\n\n- \ud83d\udd24 `message` \u2192 `STRING`\n- \ud83c\udfb2 `seed` \u2192 `INT`\n- \ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f `guidance_scale` \u2192 `FLOAT`\n- \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f `hero_image` \u2192 `IMAGE`\n\n## \u2705 Why this workflow matters\n\nThis demonstrates the V3 architecture without using fragile dynamic socket mutation. Each extractor has a fixed backend output type.\n"
      ],
      "title": "\ud83e\udded README: Run Steps",
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
